UID:47746-1777402800-1777406400@beachmetro.com
SUMMARY:Scouts Canada Open House
DESCRIPTION:Scouts Canada is excited to announce that we are opening new Sections to help reduce the waitlist and provide more Scouting opportunities for families and youth aged 5 to 14!\nTo introduce these new Sections\, we’ll be hosting open houses where you can:\nLearn more about our program and opportunities to share Scouting experiences with your child(ren)\nMeet our team\nInvite your child(ren) to participate in fun Scouting activities! \nThese activities will give your child a taste of what Scouting is all about\, and it’s a great chance for parents to connect with us and ask any questions.\nA parent\, guardian\, or family member must stay for the entire duration of the activities.\nOpen House Details: See attached image for Dates\, Times\, and Location\, \nHelp Us Bring Scouting to Life:\nTo officially launch this new Section\, we need at least 4 volunteers per Section. If you’re interested in getting involved\, the open house is the perfect opportunity to learn more.\nVolunteering with Scouts Canada is flexible and rewarding—and you don’t need any prior experience! Here’s what you can look forward to:\nSharing memorable experiences with your child\nBeing a part of a supportive community of parents and volunteers\nDeveloping new skills and sharing your expertise\nMaking a positive impact in your local community\nHaving fun and enjoying new outdoor adventures! \nWe would like to invite you to come out\, learn more and see if Scouting is a good fit for you and your family.\nPlease RSVP using the QR code on the attached image. if you plan to attend please feel free reach out if you have any questions about the Scouting program or volunteering. We look forward to seeing you and sharing the fun\, learning\, and adventure of Scouting!
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/scouts-canada-open-house-5/
LOCATION:St. John Catholic Curch\, 780 Kingston Rd.\, Toronto\, 780 Kingston Rd.
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://d28bcn7yu97icd.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/03134156/Open-House-Poster-146TO_fix3.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Scouts Canada - 146 Toronto":MAILTO:brayden.dueck@scouts.ca
END:VEVENT
